ETL Madness FlowUI
******************

This manual documents *FlowUI* (Flow Builder Studio), the interactive
.NET 10 ASP.NET Core Blazor Server web application for visually
designing, configuring, signing, encrypting, validating, executing, and
monitoring XML ETL pipelines powered by 'go-flow' and 'go-flowAPI'.

* Menu:

* Overview and Architecture::   Stateless frontend design and package layout.
* Invoking flow-ui::            Command-line options and launcher wrapper.
* Configuration File::          Syntax and variables for 'flow-ui.env'.
* OS Services and Daemons::     systemd, OpenRC, SysVinit, FreeBSD/OpenBSD rc.d, launchd, and Windows SCM.

