1 Overview and Architecture
***************************

'FlowUI' is a stateless visual studio and orchestration frontend built
on .NET 10 ASP.NET Core Blazor Server.  It does not connect directly to
any application database; all artifact persistence, validation,
execution, SSE streaming, user/group/pipeline-group/ACL administration,
and telemetry flow over HTTP/HTTPS to 'go-flowAPI'.

Packages install isolated under '/opt/flow-ui' on Unix platforms (Linux,
macOS, FreeBSD, and OpenBSD) and 'C:\Program Files\ETL Madness\Flow UI\'
on Windows, so FlowUI can be installed side-by-side with 'go-flow'
('/opt/flow') and 'go-flowAPI' ('/opt/flow-api') with zero file
collisions.

