2 Invoking 'flow-ui'
********************

Synopsis:

     flow-ui [--env-file PATH] [--urls URLS] [--contentRoot PATH] [--service-name NAME]
     flow-ui --version | --help

On Unix systems, '/opt/flow-ui/bin/flow-ui' launches the published .NET
10 application in '/opt/flow-ui/app/' with '--contentRoot
/opt/flow-ui/app' so static assets and embedded documentation resolve
regardless of the caller's working directory.

