4 OS Services and Daemons
*************************

   * *Linux systemd*: '/usr/lib/systemd/system/flow-ui.service' (user
     'flowui', state '/var/lib/flow-ui').
   * *Linux OpenRC / SysVinit*: Templates in
     '/opt/flow-ui/share/services/'.
   * *FreeBSD rc.d*: '/usr/local/etc/rc.d/flow_ui' (enable via 'sysrc
     flow_ui_enable="YES"'; requires FreeBSD 'dotnet' package).
   * *OpenBSD rc.d*: '/etc/rc.d/flow_ui' (enable via 'rcctl enable
     flow_ui'; requires a custom/ported .NET 10 runtime on OpenBSD).
   * *macOS launchd*:
     '/opt/flow-ui/share/services/launchd/com.etlmadness.flow-ui.plist'.
   * *Windows SCM*: Native Windows Service support in 'FlowUI.exe' with
     'Install-FlowUIService.ps1' and 'Uninstall-FlowUIService.ps1'.

